{"title":"Science summer programs","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Science summer programs</b>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#U.S._Science_programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">U.S. Science programs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Elementary_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elementary school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Middle_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Middle school</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#High_school\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">High school</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"U.S._Science_programs\">U.S. Science programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: U.S. Science programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elementary_school\">Elementary school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Elementary school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cub_Creek_Science_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cub Creek Science Camp (page does not exist)\">Cub Creek Science Camp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.bearriverranch.com/ccmain.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Space_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Space Camp (page does not exist)\">Space Camp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.spacecamp.com/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Middle_school\">Middle school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Middle school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.jhu.edu/gifted/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Crow_Canyon_Archeological_Center&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Crow Canyon Archeological Center (page does not exist)\">Crow Canyon Archeological Center</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.crowcanyon.org/programs/teens_and_families.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cub_Creek_Science_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cub Creek Science Camp (page does not exist)\">Cub Creek Science Camp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.bearriverranch.com/ccmain.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.cybermath.academy\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sally_Ride_Science_Camps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sally Ride Science Camps (page does not exist)\">Sally Ride Science Camps</a> for girls.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.educationunlimited.com/sallyride/science.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sea_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sea Camp (page does not exist)\">Sea Camp</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"San Diego (page does not exist)\">San Diego</a>.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.seacamp.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seacamp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Seacamp (page does not exist)\">Seacamp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.seacamp.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Space_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Space Camp (page does not exist)\">Space Camp</a> (Space Academy) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.spacecamp.com/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"High_school\">High school</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: High school\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Crow_Canyon_Archeological_Center&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Crow Canyon Archeological Center (page does not exist)\">Crow Canyon Archeological Center</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.crowcanyon.org/programs/teens_and_families.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cub_Creek_Science_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cub Creek Science Camp (page does not exist)\">Cub Creek Science Camp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.bearriverranch.com/ccmain.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CyberMath_Academy\" title=\"CyberMath Academy\">CyberMath Academy</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.cybermath.academy\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Environmental_Studies_Summer_Youth_Institute&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Environmental Studies Summer Youth Institute (page does not exist)\">Environmental Studies Summer Youth Institute</a> (ESSYI) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://academic.hws.edu/enviro/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_AI_in_Visual_Arts_Camp\" title=\"MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp\">MehtA+ AI in Visual Arts Camp</a> is a mini-bootcamp for grades 5-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-in-visual-arts/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=MehtA%2B_Machine_Learning_Bootcamp\">MehtA+ AI/Machine Learning Bootcamp</a> is a virtual research program for grades 8-12 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mehtaplustutoring.com/ai-ml-research-bootcamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Minority_Introduction_to_Engineering_and_Science\" title=\"Minority Introduction to Engineering and Science\">Minority Introduction to Engineering and Science</a> (MITES) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://web.mit.edu/mites/www/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_Youth_Science_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"National Youth Science Camp (page does not exist)\">National Youth Science Camp</a> (NYSC) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nysacademy.org/programs/nyscamp/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Summer_School_for_Young_Physicists\" title=\"International Summer School for Young Physicists\">International Summer School for Young Physicists</a> (ISSYP) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.youngphysicists.ca\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Research_Science_Institute\" title=\"Research Science Institute\">Research Science Institute</a> (RSI) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.cee.org/programs/research-science-institute\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sally_Ride_Science_Camps&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sally Ride Science Camps (page does not exist)\">Sally Ride Science Camps</a> for girls.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.educationunlimited.com/sallyride/science.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sea_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Sea Camp (page does not exist)\">Sea Camp</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"San Diego (page does not exist)\">San Diego</a>.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.seacamp.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seacamp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Seacamp (page does not exist)\">Seacamp</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.seacamp.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Space_Camp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Space Camp (page does not exist)\">Space Camp</a> (Advanced Space Academy) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.spacecamp.com/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Summer_STEM_Institute&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Summer STEM Institute (page does not exist)\">Summer STEM Institute</a> (SSI) is a virtual-first program <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.summersteminstitute.org/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Talaria_Summer_Institute\" title=\"Talaria Summer Institute\">Talaria Summer Institute</a> is a free summer STEM research mentorship program for female and genderqueer students <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://talariasummerinstitute.org/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_summer_programs&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_summer_programs\" title=\"Academic summer programs\">Academic summer programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science\" title=\"Science\">Science</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_books\" title=\"Science books\">Science books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_scholarships\" title=\"Science scholarships\">Science scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_competitions\" title=\"Science competitions\">Science competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018031608\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1545:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018031608 and revision id 188421. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}